        "ROB_RAVAGER_BODY_THROW_UNLOCKABLE_ACHIEVEMENT_DESC": "Nei panni di Ravager, consuma 8 o più nemici contemporaneamente.",
        "ROB_RAVAGER_BODY_BEAM_UNLOCKABLE_UNLOCKABLE_NAME": "Ravager: Calm as an Ocean",
